497	     *  statement (live again); a new OPEN claim of the same person with the split-off amount, the same date and
498	     *  note and tags, opened by {@code by}, with its due-by fixed now and the original's number as split-from, is added
499	     *  (unnumbered: the caller numbers it; a late entry when its due-by falls in a soft-closed period). The new claim's id, or null when the sheet has no such OPEN claim. */
